s (to be determined) and merchandising\nIf you have any NG items, we would appreciate it if you could describe them in a separate layer.\nWe will not use them for any other purposes.\n\nOthers\nPSD format is preferred. It would be appreciated if you could separate the background, the person, and the signature and deliver them separately.\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@foaN29447251/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 624671, "client_id": 1730140, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/625c141b/uploads/origins/f59aa94f-76f2-4b93-b287-d6d06ee8ef06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2144e0982452ff660ecbc78dfeee7847", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/625c141b/uploads/origins/f59aa94f-76f2-4b93-b287-d6d06ee8ef06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2144e0982452ff660ecbc78dfeee7847, https://si.imgix.net/625c141b/uploads/origins/f59aa94f-76f2-4b93-b287-d6d06ee8ef06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0ec5dc0d5881511348de521fe891377 2x, https://si.imgix.net/625c141b/uploads/origins/f59aa94f-76f2-4b93-b287-d6d06ee8ef06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08b751927ee3f26b56f8c4a2cd072964 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/625c141b/uploads/origins/f59aa94f-76f2-4b93-b287-d6d06ee8ef06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8c36ff5d7519d19c7bcb804323f570c7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/625c141b/uploads/origins/f59aa94f-76f2-4b93-b287-d6d06ee8ef06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8c36ff5d7519d19c7bcb804323f570c7, https://si.imgix.